so I'll just tell you.

237
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:54,850
OURI: I'm gonna make that chick 
fall for me someday.

238
00:12:55,610 --> 00:12:58,010
OURI: The rest of this info doesn't matter.

239
00:12:58,010 --> 00:13:01,310
OURI: She's an obsessive Tamon fangirl 
and also his housekeeper.

