292
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:09,620
TAMON: When I die, I want to make sure 
I die without troubling anyone.

293
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:12,070
UTAGE: Please don't risk your life making a cake!

294
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:14,910
TAMON: Okay, I've learned the steps.

295
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:18,070
UTAGE: Yes. First, you need to sift 
the weak flour through a sifter.

296
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:20,410
TAMON: Ah...

297
00:15:20,410 --> 00:15:21,410
UTAGE: He's terrible at this.

298
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:25,190
UTAGE: No wonder a dust explosion 
occurred earlier.

299
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:30,170
UTAGE: Next, he needs to melt 
the butter in hot water.

300
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:33,340
UTAGE: And he put it directly into the hot water!

301
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:33,340
TAMON: It's hot!

302
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:38,160
UTAGE: I won't help, 
but can I watch you from here?

303
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:40,250
UTAGE: I love watching cakes being made.

304
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:42,560
TAMON: R-Really?

305
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:43,720
UTAGE: Yes!

306
00:15:54,690 --> 00:15:58,730
UTAGE: This takes me back to when I made 
a birthday cake for Tamon-kun.

