316
00:15:59,570 --> 00:16:02,660
SIGN: A Birthday Party Without the Actual Birthday Boy

317
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:06,160
UTAGE: Baking cakes is fun, isn't it?

318
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:10,830
TAMON: On my birthday, my fans make me cakes.

319
00:16:10,830 --> 00:16:13,590
TAMON: It's not like I can actually eat those, 

320
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:15,250
TAMON: but they make me happy.

321
00:16:15,250 --> 00:16:17,550
TAMON: Cakes really are special.

322
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:20,510
UTAGE: And then all of his followers cried!

323
00:16:21,590 --> 00:16:26,110
UTAGE: All of your fans around the world 
would sob if they heard you say that.

324
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:29,020
UTAGE: We're all making them 
filled with our love after all.

325
00:16:30,450 --> 00:16:31,580
TAMON: Love...

326
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:35,020
TAMON: Okay, I'll put all of my feelings 
into making this, too.

327
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:41,700
TAMON: I hope that Kinoshita-san will be 
able to deliciously enjoy this cake.

328
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:42,700
UTAGE: He's too friggin' cute!

329
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:46,750
TAMON: I hope that Kinoshita-san will 
continue coming over forever.

330
00:16:47,110 --> 00:16:48,870
UTAGE: You're giving me that privilege?!

331
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:53,670
TAMON: I hope that Kinoshita-san never hates me.

332
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:54,540
UTAGE: That won't happen—

333
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:56,200
TAMON: And never betrays me.

334
00:16:57,890 --> 00:16:58,890
UTAGE: Huh...?

335
00:17:00,110 --> 00:17:02,480
TAMON: Or cheats on me.

336
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:07,700
TAMON: May she never show any interest in
 the rest of humanity for all her life.

337
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,660
TAMON: I'm going to make this delicious.

338
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,410
MUSHROOMS: Gloom, gloom, gloom, gloom...

339
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:36,800
UTAGE: I thought he was better now, 
but he's still acting weird.

340
00:17:37,470 --> 00:17:39,460
TAMON: No matter how much of a failure I am, 

341
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:42,550
TAMON: please just be my fan, Kinoshita-san.

342
00:17:42,850 --> 00:17:45,730
UTAGE: Does anyone say all that 
to their housekeeper?

343
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:49,810
UTAGE: I mean, I told him that 
I'd only ever be his fan, but...

344
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:55,660
UTAGE: I-It's done!

345
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
SIGN: Kill... me...

346
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
SIGN: Kill... me...

347
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
SIGN: Kill... me...

348
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
SIGN: Kill... me...

349
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
SIGN: Kinoshita-san

350
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,190
CAKE: Kill... me... Kill... me...

351
00:17:56,190 --> 00:18:00,740
UTAGE: Wow! A homemade cake that my oshi made!

352
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,900
CAKE: I'm going to freeze it 
and make it my gravestone!

353
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,070
TAMON: No...

354
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:07,410
TAMON: Please, eat it.

355
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:11,260
TAMON: I even bought some delicious 
Poca Cola to go with it.

356
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:12,750
UTAGE: I'm sorry.

357
00:18:12,750 --> 00:18:14,580
UTAGE: But I'm currently working, so...

358
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:17,420
UTAGE: I'll humbly accept the thought, though.

359
00:18:19,380 --> 00:18:23,040
UTAGE: Oh, no. I made Tamon-kun sad.

360
00:18:23,390 --> 00:18:25,470
UTAGE: But I just can't...

361
00:18:25,470 --> 00:18:27,270
UTAGE: I'll go clean the bathroom!

362
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:31,930
UTAGE: Huh?

363
00:18:36,430 --> 00:18:37,360
TAMON: Eat it.

364
00:18:40,430 --> 00:18:42,210
TAMON: Even just a bite.

365
00:18:44,340 --> 00:18:46,490
TAMON: Come on. Please?

366
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:51,410
TAMON: Open up.

367
00:18:54,410 --> 00:18:57,450
TAMON: Accept it... All of my love.

368
00:18:57,850 --> 00:18:59,650
UTAGE: Tamon-kun, no...

369
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,380
UTAGE: We mustn't...

370
00:19:06,420 --> 00:19:07,970
UTAGE: It has no taste.

371
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,400
UTAGE: W-Well, 

372
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:16,350
UTAGE: it's not unusual to have some tea 
and snacks after finishing work, 

373
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,940
UTAGE: so a little won't hurt...

374
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:20,920
UTAGE: Okay, I'm done cleaning, 
so I'll have some.

375
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:23,980
UTAGE: This is the first time in my life

376
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:27,410
UTAGE: that someone gifted me a whole cake 
on a completely random day.

377
00:19:34,930 --> 00:19:36,040
UTAGE: It's delicious.

378
00:19:38,790 --> 00:19:41,640
MUSHROOMS: Gloomy, gloom... Gloomy, gloom...

379
00:19:38,790 --> 00:19:43,880
UTAGE: I had been treating Tamon-kun like 
a cute little needy puppy...

380
00:19:44,290 --> 00:19:46,370
UTAGE: But then he got all weird to the point

381
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:51,070
UTAGE: that I'm getting worried that 
he might not even be from this planet.

382
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:53,600
TAMON: Have some cola, too.

383
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:56,150
UTAGE: Th-Thank you very much.

384
00:19:56,150 --> 00:20:00,310
UTAGE: He... totally flipped his switch 
on purpose earlier, didn't he?

385
00:20:02,740 --> 00:20:03,860
TAMON: Let's eat.

386
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:08,340
UTAGE: He did that knowing full well 
that would stop me, didn't he?

387
00:20:09,090 --> 00:20:12,240
UTAGE: Looking back on it now, 
this isn't the first time it happened.

388
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:16,330
UTAGE: Lately, it's almost been normal 
to be so close to him, 

389
00:20:16,330 --> 00:20:20,790
UTAGE: but Gloomyhara-san is a super idol who
 puts people everywhere under his spell.

390
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:24,750
UTAGE: And he's playing a character
he created to do just that.

391
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:29,350
UTAGE: Meaning, finessing one fangirl 
would be nothing to him.

392
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:33,040
SIGN: Kinoshita-san

393
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:33,050
UTAGE: And he definitely finessed me... 
This is dangerous.

394
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:34,890
UTAGE: I should get going.

395
00:20:34,890 --> 00:20:36,570
TAMON: What? Already?

396
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,110
UTAGE: This fanservice is so extreme...

397
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:43,050
UTAGE: He's basically devaluing 
himself as an idol.

398
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:46,400
UTAGE: I can't let this escalate any further.

399
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:51,200
UTAGE: I'll take the rest home with me. 
Could I borrow an ice pack?

400
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:52,870
TAMON: Oh... sure.

401
00:20:53,740 --> 00:20:55,690
TAMON: I need to keep my distance.

402
00:20:56,450 --> 00:20:59,290
TAMON: Being overprotective isn't always love.

403
00:20:59,970 --> 00:21:03,100
TAMON: I need him to be able to 
survive on his own.

404
00:21:04,630 --> 00:21:07,530
TAMON: Kinoshita-san, you've got some 
frosting on your face.

405
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:08,520
UTAGE: Huh?

406
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:09,430
TAMON: Right here.

407
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:12,510
UTAGE: It's fine! Please stay back!

408
00:21:12,510 --> 00:21:15,350
UTAGE: You needn't dirty your hands 
over something like this!

409
00:21:17,990 --> 00:21:20,060
TAMON: You don't need to hold back.

410
00:21:20,060 --> 00:21:21,030
UTAGE: Huh?

411
00:21:31,850 --> 00:21:34,700
TAMON: We're closer than that, aren't we, Utage?

412
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:35,840
UTAGE: He...

413
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:37,340
UTAGE: He did it again!

414
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:38,790
UTAGE: This fanservice is too extreme!

415
00:21:39,580 --> 00:21:41,380
TAMON: I'm sorry. I just reacted.

416
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:47,710
TAMON: But I figured you'd be
okay with it, Kinoshita-san.

417
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:47,710
SIGN: Kinoshita

418
00:21:47,710 --> 00:21:48,850
UTAGE: Huh?

419
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:53,620
UTAGE: He's sulky, gloomy, and always 
sensitive to others' moods.

420
00:21:54,110 --> 00:21:57,350
UTAGE: That's exactly what 
makes him a sharpshooter...

421
00:21:55,010 --> 00:21:57,350
SIGN: Kinoshita-san

422
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:00,980
TAMON: Because...

423
00:22:02,030 --> 00:22:05,340
TAMON: You think I'm hot.

424
00:22:07,940 --> 00:22:12,580
UTAGE: Tamon-kun's... always been like that.

